{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方第一块大号白色文字“明知道回去未必找得回那份亲近，他却还是忍不住想：万一能呢？”，字号最大、亮度高且位置靠上。随后容易被下方另一块同样醒目的大字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"明知道回去未必能找回曾经的亲近，却仍然放不下回去的念头。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不舍、留恋、期待，带着一点侥幸。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他当前其实不愿仅凭这点希望就回去忍让，而是想先把眼下日子过稳；虽然仍然害怕、心里没底，却不想因此收回向前走的打算。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样显眼的大字争夺主视线，第一块讲回头的留恋，第二块讲当下的选择。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块里，要拼起来才懂他既有回头的念头，又决定先往前走。\",\n    \"下方单块较长，包含不愿回头、稳定生活、害怕没底、不收回打算等多层意思，需要继续读才能理清关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fcb2cc2f-fa6e-447b-888a-e4d922896a79", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013920581133Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:39:48.472320+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c4747b220cadced5a3d15efe549582e8df26aa9a23206fb17a6532d6d8d4befb", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9